@abstract:
Declared future intent for IDApTIK — game engine, multiplayer,
ReScript migration, formal verification, and developer tools.
@end

@requires:
- section: Migration
- section: Engine
- section: Multiplayer
- section: Tools
- section: Quality
@end

## Migration

### rescript-13-upgrade
- description: Upgrade from ReScript 12.2.0 to 13.x
- status: in-progress
- priority: critical
- evidence: command: grep -q '"rescript": "13' deno.json 2>/dev/null || grep -q '"rescript": "13' package.json 2>/dev/null
- notes: Config is v13-clean; blocker is rescript-legacy UTF-8 crash

### belt-removal
- description: Remove all Belt.* API usage (replaced by @rescript/core)
- status: realised
- priority: critical
- evidence: command: grep -rn 'Belt\.' src/ --include='*.res' | wc -l | grep -q '^0$'
- notes: Completed 2026-03-09

### deprecated-js-removal
- description: Remove all deprecated Js.* APIs
- status: realised
- priority: critical
- evidence: command: grep -rn 'Js\.\(Dict\|Array2\|String2\)' src/ --include='*.res' | wc -l | grep -q '^0$'
- notes: Completed 2026-03-03

## Engine

### vm-tier4-instructions
- description: Complete Tier 4 VM instructions
- status: in-progress
- priority: high
- evidence: command: grep -c 'Tier4' vm/lib/ocaml/*.res 2>/dev/null | grep -v '^0$'

### asset-pipeline-v2
- description: Upgrade AssetPack pipeline for PixiJS 8
- status: declared
- priority: medium

## Multiplayer

### phoenix-sync-stability
- description: Stabilise Phoenix sync server for production
- status: in-progress
- priority: high
- evidence: command: test -d sync-server/lib

### playwright-e2e
- description: Full Playwright E2E test suite for multiplayer
- status: in-progress
- priority: medium
- evidence: command: find . -name '*.spec.ts' -o -name '*.spec.js' | wc -l | grep -v '^0$'

