## Quality

### test-coverage
- description: Achieve 80%+ test coverage on shared module
- status: in-progress
- priority: high
- evidence: command: test -d shared/tests

### contractile-ci
- description: Run contractile checks in CI pipeline
- status: declared
- priority: medium
- evidence: command: grep -q 'contractile' .github/workflows/*.yml 2>/dev/null
